WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:08.160
You need about ten spinach leaves, coffee filters, a glass jar with a lid that is

2
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:12.600
never used for food again, and adult-only rubbing alcohol and safety glasses.

3
00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:16.253
Your child cuts filter strips and tears spinach.

4
00:00:17.193 --> 00:00:18.993
The adult pours alcohol and mashes.

5
00:00:20.113 --> 00:00:21.993
Cap the jar for fifteen to thirty minutes.

6
00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:24.433
Then the adult stands a strip in it.

7
00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:28.247
Colors climb the strip over thirty to ninety minutes.

8
00:00:29.287 --> 00:00:32.127
Expect a wide green band, and often a thin yellow band.

9
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:36.360
The adult handles the rubbing alcohol from start to finish.

10
00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:39.820
It is poisonous to swallow and catches fire easily.

11
00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:42.100
Children look, never touch.

12
00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:46.460
Ages five to seven do leaf rubbing instead, with no alcohol.
